    "background_story": "Jrue was a unique individual, born with a rare condition that made him almost entirely hairless. Despite the initial shock and stares from strangers, Jrue's family and friends accepted him for who he was. As he grew older, Jrue learned to see his depilous nature as a blessing in disguise. He never had to worry about bad hair days or shaving, and his smooth skin made him a natural in the pool. Jrue became a competitive swimmer, using his sleek physique to his advantage. He broke records and won championships, earning the respect and admiration of his peers. Jrue's confidence and self-acceptance inspired others to look beyond physical appearances and celebrate their own individuality.",
